\begin_layout Standard
\begin_inset Formula $\dfrac{\tau_{A}}{\tau_{B}}=\dfrac{\dfrac{2\eta}{\eta^{2}-1}\dfrac{d}{v_{o}}}{\dfrac{2}{\sqrt{\eta^{2}-1}}\dfrac{d}{v_{o}}}=\dfrac{\eta}{\sqrt{\eta^{2}-1}}$
\end_inset


